{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Hell \u2013 Chaos by Ricochet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebound Hell</strong> is a minimalist, <strong>top-down action game</strong> where every ball you fire is a <strong>double-edged sword</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a small, square arena. With <strong>each shot</strong>, a white ball is launched. If it hits an enemy, it deals damage. But beware: with <strong>each bounce off a wall, the ball turns red... and can damage you in turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each white bounce has a chance to spawn an enemy around the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies quickly swarm the area, forcing you to <strong>manage your shots intelligently</strong>, or you'll be overwhelmed by your own <strong>ricochets</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 HP. Limited healing. No mercy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Upgrade System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 white ball bounces, a <strong>yellow ball is automatically fired</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick it up to trigger a <strong>random upgrade</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades That Change <strong>Everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Just Stat Bonuses! Some upgrades completely change how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bomb that explodes red bullets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A radar that slows enemies down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hourglass that freezes enemies in time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades react to the number of bullets in play or your movement speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 types of enemies</strong>, from simple magazines to fast-moving, lethal brains, to enemies that transform into obstacles in the arena. Each one adds a <strong>new layer of pressure.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Completely Different Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Unique Bosses!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maximum Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original enemy spawn patterns linked to your own shots.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, <strong>increasing difficulty</strong>: the longer you survive, the denser the chaos becomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique leaderboard that sets you apart from other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ultra-minimalist pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic, dark electro/synthwave soundtrack that builds in intensity.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820820?t=1768945059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/068172cb4ce2eadb2f0fa6d4916e7d79a055d3dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768945059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/1f7afec031614e55ac9d81187210a80910f4a043/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768945059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/1f7afec031614e55ac9d81187210a80910f4a043/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768945059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4058980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Hell \u2013 Chaos by Ricochet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebound Hell</strong> is a minimalist, <strong>top-down action game</strong> where every ball you fire is a <strong>double-edged sword</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a small, square arena. With <strong>each shot</strong>, a white ball is launched. If it hits an enemy, it deals damage. But beware: with <strong>each bounce off a wall, the ball turns red... and can damage you in turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/4c22ea47bef19198a7a3c5a592c1a453.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each white bounce has a chance to spawn an enemy around the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies quickly swarm the area, forcing you to <strong>manage your shots intelligently</strong>, or you'll be overwhelmed by your own <strong>ricochets</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 HP. Limited healing. No mercy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/736876786b363bf2f60ab421bbb250eb.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Upgrade System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 white ball bounces, a <strong>yellow ball is automatically fired</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick it up to trigger a <strong>random upgrade</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/e40c2bc96274ef701702ac8f7a225412.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades That Change <strong>Everything</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not Just Stat Bonuses! Some upgrades completely change how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bomb that explodes red bullets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A radar that slows enemies down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hourglass that freezes enemies in time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades react to the number of bullets in play or your movement speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 types of enemies</strong>, from simple magazines to fast-moving, lethal brains, to enemies that transform into obstacles in the arena. Each one adds a <strong>new layer of pressure.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Completely Different Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Unique Bosses!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.poster.avif?t=1768945059\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.webm?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/extras/b6a35a7e2442a3f356688769b6ed3d42.mp4?t=1768945059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maximum Replayability</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original enemy spawn patterns linked to your own shots.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear, <strong>increasing difficulty</strong>: the longer you survive, the denser the chaos becomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique leaderboard that sets you apart from other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ultra-minimalist pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic, dark electro/synthwave soundtrack that builds in intensity.</p></li></ul>","developers":["mrtsGAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820820/44043593da93261182bf85bf3d6d910e717c3a17/header.jpg?t=1768945059","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Rebound Hell Devs. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820820/1022064003/8ad7524ab9980cbdefc7db7738be10994f4e4525/1768155141/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768156335","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820820/1022064003/8ad7524ab9980cbdefc7db7738be10994f4e4525/1768155141/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768156335","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820820/1022064003/8ad7524ab9980cbdefc7db7738be10994f4e4525/1768155141/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768156335","id":257203433,"name":"Rebound Hell gameplay trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203433/c6ba55786409f3e52f75f02354b6f47e62291745/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768156335"}],"name":"Rebound Hell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 Go MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Carte compatible DirectX 10 ou sup\